],"translations":[{"language":"it-IT","overview":"Il regista Pascal Plisson incontra bambini e ragazzi con disabilità in diversi Paesi del mondo. Attraverso le loro storie, il documentario mostra come l'affetto, l'istruzione inclusiva e il coraggio possano aiutarli a inseguire i propri sogni."},{"language":"en-US","overview":"Who said living with disabilities meant giving up one’s greatest dreams? Across the world, Pascal Plisson met Maud (France), Charles (Kenya), Nirmala and Khendo (Nepal), Xavier (Rwanda) and Antonio (Brazil) : extraordinary children who will prove that love, inclusive education, humour and courage can move mountains, and that fate is sometimes full of surprises."},{"language":"fr-FR","overview":"Qui a dit que vivre avec un handicap signifiait renoncer à ses plus grands rêves ? A travers le monde, Pascal Plisson est allé à la rencontre de Xavier, Charles, Antonio, Maud, Nirmala et Khendo, des enfants extraordinaires qui vont prouver que l’amour, l’éducation inclusive, l’humour et le courage peuvent déplacer des montagnes, et que le destin est parfois plein de surprises."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/pAzq7Axtgbo1gUknBp85rFwkmC.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/mUoQmNHY9TOoXuysdrooiYPZh6q.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":1140724,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"fr-FR","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"missing","candidates":[]},"en":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/V3YT1N79098h6MiF5MvWnls5Ek.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/V3YT1N79098h6MiF5MvWnls5Ek.jpg","language":"en","width":2000,"height":3000},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/V3YT1N79098h6MiF5MvWnls5Ek.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/V3YT1N79098h6MiF5MvWnls5Ek.jpg","language":"en","width":2000,"height":3